<title>UK: Norway's Oseberg to load equiv 30.7 cargoes in Jun.</title>
<headline>Norway's Oseberg to load equiv 30.7 cargoes in Jun.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Oseberg crude system is due to load the equivalent of 30.7 standard cargoes of 500,000 barrels each in June, traders said.</p>
<p>They said the programme consisted of 15 cargoes of 600,000 barrels, five cargoes of 500,000 barrels, and one each of two million, one million and 850,000 barrels.</p>
<p>The Oseberg system was due to load the equivalent of 44.2 standard 500,000 barrel cargoes in May, traders said.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 8978</p>
